  "variants": null,
  "_note": "HD44780U-compatible 16x2 character LCD module. Pin table audited against Hitachi HD44780U datasheet (ADE-207-272(Z) rev 0.0, 1998-09). 16-pin single-row header: VSS (pin 1), VDD (pin 2), V0 (pin 3, contrast), RS (pin 4, register select: 0=cmd 1=data), RW (pin 5, read/write: 0=write 1=read), E (pin 6, enable), D0-D7 (pins 7-14, data bus), A (pin 15, backlight LED anode), K (pin 16, backlight LED cathode). Supports 4-bit mode (D4-D7 only) and 8-bit mode (D0-D7). Canonical 6502 breadboard wiring: RS/RW/E to VIA PA5-PA7, D0-D7 to VIA PB0-PB7.",
